{"synopsis":"Dari studio yang mengerjakan \\[Chronicles Of The Reincarnated Demon God]\nBlacksmith terakhir sekaligus pengrajin ulung yang tersisa di dunia.\n\nTangannya hancur karena kebakaran di bengkel, membuatnya tak bisa lagi menempa.\nNamun, sebuah game realitas virtual bernama Ares pun datang mengetuk pintu Hyun-soo.\n\n\\[Artefak Tak Dapat Diperbaiki.]\n\\[Tidak dapat ditempa karena batasan level.]\n\n“Eh? Tapi aku ini Blacksmith manual, loh.”\nBagi dirinya, batasan sistem sama sekali tak berlaku.\n\nBegitulah dimulainya permainan penuh gejolak sang Blacksmith jenius.","alternative_title":"천재 대장장이의 게임","author":"Menyusul","artist":"Menyusul","chapters":[{"number":"65","chapter":"65","slug":"fa5b6062-3cd9-4c40-97c8-dad2d2a4cb69","title":"Chapter 65","date":"2026-08-01"},{"number":"64","chapter":"64","slug":"62fd2c7f-49d7-4a53-8f85-3445b4da84ce","title":"Chapter 64","date":"2026-07-25"},{"number":"63","chapter":"63","slug":"4329efa5-a4b9-489f-baa8-64f93a36f25a","title":"Chapter 63","date":"2026-07-18"},{"number":"62","chapter":"62","slug":"4f750f50-0d3b-46a3-b2af-31a264c92afe","title":"Chapter 62","date":"2026-07-11"},{"number":"61","chapter":"61","slug":"9222bf10-15a2-48f0-9757-3ba61e1b1af4","title":"Chapter 61","date":"2026-07-04"},{"number":"60","chapter":"60","slug":"b4a90a42-e29d-4643-ace7-2b587224f516","title":"Chapter 60","date":"2026-06-27"},{"number":"59","chapter":"59","slug":"3fe61a0b-951c-4ba5-afe2-da870ada5fe6","title":"Chapter 59","date":"2026-06-20"},{"number":"58","chapter":"58","slug":"26fc74fa-f143-4bf1-9050-102ba144a434","title":"Chapter 58","date":"2026-06-13"},{"number":"57","chapter":"57","slug":"87a08631-2c58-4d05-942f-eed6cd599574","title":"Chapter 57","date":"2026-06-09"},{"number":"56","chapter":"56","slug":"fea7f8cd-fe32-4634-bad1-6347fe0396ad","title":"Chapter 56","date":"2026-06-01"},{"number":"55","chapter":"55","slug":"07f7c464-4971-4abc-86cf-fe25d0639800","title":"Chapter 55","date":"2026-05-23"},{"number":"54","chapter":"54","s